  <Thumbnail>a44c5ecc-2d90-47ed-a628-7bf82387c620</Thumbnail>
  <History Date="19-05-09" Author="David Hunt" Comment="Created from 300E Spot" />
  <History Date="19-04-12" Author="Locate Fix" Comment="Updated locate, power on, highlight and lowlight values to valid values" />
  <History Date="19-04-13" Author="RDM Sync Tool" Comment="Added RDM Manufacturer information. Added RDM Fixture information. Added RDM Mode information." />
  <History Date="06-06-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed name from Robin 300E Plasma to Robin 300 Plasma Spot (confirmed correct name with manufacturer)" />
  <History Date="06-06-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's.  Added product thumbnail.  Added physical pan/tilt ranges." />
  <History Date="06-06-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised shutter functions in line with latest charts.  Added missing macros." />
  <History Date="06-06-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Standardised conditionals.  Added function index.  Increased wheel resolution.  Corrected 16bit raw display ranges." />
  <History Date="06-06-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added gobo swatches." />
  <History Date="11-07-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Reversed gobo 1 swatch order in response to customer feedback (there are two documents with conflicting orders)" />
